  "prefLabel": "Rab 102.02 Address of the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rab 102.02 Address of the Board.\n\n(a) The board shall maintain an office at 7 Eagle Square, Concord, N.H. 03301. All correspondence with the board shall be addressed as follows:\n\nNew Hampshire Real Estate Appraisers Board\n\n7 Eagle Square\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03301.\n\n(b) The telephone number of the board shall be (603) 271-2152.\n\nSource. #13824, eff 2-13-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rab100-500.html"
